        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: German submarine U-32 (S182), Type 212 submarine, Type 212A, Todaro class\n- Organizations: German Navy, German and Italian navies, Howaldtswerke-Deutsche Werft AG (HDW)\n\nFacts:\n- The German Type 212 class, also called the Italian Todaro class, is a highly advanced non-nuclear submarine design.\n- Howaldtswerke-Deutsche Werft AG (HDW) developed the Type 212 submarine design for the German and Italian navies.\n- German submarine U-32 (S182) is the second Type 212A submarine of the German Navy.",
